{"id":"hu_fte","lemma":"Hüfte","pos":"noun","rank":4426,"glosses":["hip; hips"],"ipa":"/ˈhʏftə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/13/De-H%C3%BCfte.ogg/De-H%C3%BCfte.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Hüfte","plural":"Hüften"},"formAudio":{"Hüften":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bc/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-H%C3%BCften.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Mir tut die Hüfte weh.","en":"My hip hurts.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/195485","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"to do","l":"tun"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"sore, painful"}]},{"text":"Der Mann trug eine Pistole an der Hüfte.","en":"The man wore a gun on his hip.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"man, male human being"},{"g":"to carry, to bear","l":"tragen"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"pistol, gun"},{"g":"at / on"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Die Arbeiter waren bis zu den Hüften nackt.","en":"The workers were naked to the waist.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"to work","l":"arbeiten"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},null,null,{"g":"the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"nude"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"until"]]},{"text":"Ich bin 2013 an der Hüfte operiert worden.","en":"I had hip surgery in 2013.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/761840","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"at / on"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to operate","l":"operieren"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"}]},{"text":"Das Wasser reichte mir bis an die Hüfte.","en":"The water came up to my waist.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"water"},{"g":"to reach","l":"reichen"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"until, to, through"},{"g":"at / on"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}